[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（この船の向かう先に――無数島群域、\n\u3000そしてノーヴァ神聖国がある）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Beyond this ship lies the Infinite Island Chain... and the sacred lands of Nova."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そこで「果ての大陸」への手掛かりが\n\u3000きっと見つかるはず……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sure we'll find a path to World's End there..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア！\u3000こっちの船に来てたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria! When did you come aboard?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特にやることもないから、遊びに来たのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just thought I'd drop by. There wasn't much else to do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。確かに、波も風も穏やかだし、\n魔物もぜんぜん出てこないしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "True. The seas are calm, and we haven't seen any monsters at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "邪魔だった頂獣も倒しちゃったものね。\nあとはのんびり船旅か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And with that troublesome Apexi gone, we can finally enjoy a peaceful voyage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃーん！\u3000そろそろご飯だよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resnaaa! It's dinner time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、い、し、い、ご、は、ん、だ、よー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've got something super duper tasty!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、イザナちゃん。ベップさんに習ったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana! Did you pick that up from Bepp?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000ってあれ、ヴァレリアも\n来てたんだ！\u3000一緒にご飯食べてく？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! Oh, Valeria's here too! Want to join us for dinner?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいの？\u3000じゃあ遠慮なく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you don't mind, I'd love to!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁベップ、ぜひとも召し上がってくれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come now, Bepp, please join us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すべてに感謝を込めて、いただきます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you. It would be my pleasure."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船上でここまで豪華な食事を用意できるなんて、\n大陸の錬金術士、なかなかのなかなかね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Preparing such an extravagant meal at sea... these mainland alchemists are quite something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。かわいらしい使者ですわね。\nララ円卓騎士団に似合いそうですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, what an adorable envoy. She'd make a fine addition to the Knights of Lara."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ・キングダムは特別職が多いなぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Kingdom of Lara sure has a lot of special positions..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララさん、無闇に引き抜こうとしたらダメですよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now Lara, you can't go around trying to recruit everyone you meet!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はむ、はむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*munch munch*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア、美味しい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How is it, Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000美味しい。フロッケのご飯が一番だけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Delicious! Though Flocke's cooking is still my favorite."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケちゃんのご飯、絶品だもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Her food is amazing, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "味もそうだけど、なんだか懐かしい感じがするの。\n目が覚める前の記憶なのかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not just the taste... something about it feels nostalgic. Could it be something from my past?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっとそうだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I bet you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私が目を覚まして１年。\n随分、遠い所まで来ちゃったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's been a year since I regained consciousness. We've come such a long way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に大変だったね。\nこの船を造るのにも苦労したし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really was quite the journey. Building this ship alone was such an ordeal."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王国の領地の外まで素材集めに行ったもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We had to venture beyond the kingdom's borders just to gather materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "途中、厄介な奴らに絡まれたりもして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And those troublemakers we ran into along the way..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……色んなことがあったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... we've been through a lot together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]